Third-party components
----------------------

The Android app in `apps/android/` is a fork of FreeKiosk
(https://github.com/rushb-fr/freekiosk), Copyright (c) 2025 Rushb, licensed
under the MIT License. The upstream copyright notice and licence text are kept
verbatim at `apps/android/LICENSE`, and both apply to that code in addition to
the notice above.

